<BaseLayout title="HOA Management Software for Florida CAM Companies | Camvella" description="HOA management software for Florida community association management companies. Manage accounting, violations, ARC, boards, residents, work orders, vendors, documents, and communications in one platform." schema={schema}>
<section class="loc-hero"><div class="container"><p class="section__label">Florida HOA management software</p><h1>HOA software for Florida CAM companies managing real portfolios.</h1><p>Camvella helps Florida community association management teams connect accounting, compliance, architectural requests, board operations, resident service, vendors, work orders, documents, and communications.</p><a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/demo">Book a Demo</a></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2 class="section__headline">Built for the operating reality of community management.</h2><div class="loc-grid"><article><h3>Portfolio accounting</h3><p>Keep assessments, receivables, payables, budgets, general ledger activity, and financial reports organized by association.</p></article><article><h3>Violations & ARC</h3><p>Track notices, inspections, supporting documents, committee review, board decisions, and resident communication in one history.</p></article><article><h3>Boards & residents</h3><p>Give boards secure access to governance and financial information while residents get mobile self-service for common requests.</p></article><article><h3>Maintenance & vendors</h3><p>Coordinate service requests, work orders, vendor assignments, insurance records, attachments, and completion history.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section section--alt"><div class="container container--narrow"><h2 class="section__headline">Serving Florida teams without pretending geography is a feature.</h2><p class="section__subhead">The value is the workflow: association separation, financial depth, compliance tracking, portals, documents, and communication records that stay connected. Camvella is web-based, so Florida teams can work across offices and communities from the same platform.</p><p style="margin-top:20px"><a href="/solutions/hoa-management-software">Explore HOA management software →</a> · <a href="/features/hoa-accounting">Explore HOA accounting →</a></p></div></section>
<section class="section section--dark"><div class="container"><h2 class="section__headline" style="color:#fff">Use a Florida community in your demo.</h2><p class="section__subhead">Walk through the accounting and operations your team handles every week.</p><a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/demo">Book a Demo</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
